Package: sddsParticle
Title: Control SDDS Particle Devices
Version: 0.7.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Sebastian", "Kopf", , "seb.kopf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a web-based graphical user interface and a matching
    programmatic interface to monitor and control microcontrollers that run
    self-describing data structure (SDDS) firmware on Particle
    (<https://www.particle.io>) devices. The SDDS firmware describes its own
    variable tree, which the interface reads to automatically build an
    editable view of each device; from there values can be changed, commands
    queued and sent, the command history inspected, and live data events
    streamed.
